{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"title":[{"Plain":"“Pontryagin 类”"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Pontryagin 类"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>实向量丛的复化给出了包含映射\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{B}O(n)\\to \\mathrm{B}U(n),\r\n$$\nPontryagin 类 $p_k\\in H^{4k}(\\mathrm{B}O(n))$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"陈类","text":"陈类"}},{"Plain":" $c_{2k}$ 的拉回乘以 $(-1)^k$.</p>\n"}]}}